//
// Thin synthesis wrapper around Ara's vector unit (the `ara` module).
//
// Bare `ara` cannot elaborate with its default parameters (NrLanes=0,
// VLEN=0, and many `type ... = logic` parameters). This wrapper fixes a
// concrete configuration (NrLanes=2, VLEN=4096) and builds the AXI and
// CVA6 accelerator interface struct types, mirroring the construction in
// ara_soc.sv / ara_system.sv, then instantiates `ara` and brings its
// interfaces out as top-level ports. It deliberately does NOT instantiate
// the CVA6 scalar core, so the benchmark measures only the vector unit.

